Package: marbellaprices
Type: Package
Title: Marbella Wire Open Price Datasets
Version: 2026.9.4
Authors@R: person(given = "Marbella Wire",
                  role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                  email = "editor@marbellawire.com")
Description: Three open price datasets for Marbella, on the Spanish Costa del
    Sol, published by Marbella Wire: the Sunbed Index (what it costs to put two
    people on sunbeds for a weekday in high season), a census of chiringuitos
    (beach restaurants) with menu prices, and a census of beach clubs with their
    published day rates. Every figure is read from a venue's own price list or
    menu and carries the source URL and the date it was read. A blank is always
    "the venue does not publish this", never a zero and never an estimate. The
    figures are released under CC BY 4.0; see the LICENSE-DATA file. Loader code
    is MIT. No hard dependencies.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://marbellawire.com/prices/,
    https://github.com/shiftdylson1/marbella-price-data
BugReports: https://github.com/shiftdylson1/marbella-price-data/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
